For a well-established company in OOSTENDE, we are looking for an EXPERIENCED WELDER.

Are you an experienced welder who enjoys working independently and taking on technically challenging projects? Do you have experience with semi-automatic welding and are you able to read technical drawings?

Your responsibilities as an EXPERIENCED WELDER in OOSTENDE:

• You carry out semi-automatic welding work;
• You weld metal parts and structures according to technical drawings;
• You are responsible for various repair works. THIS IS NOT A REPETITIVE JOB – you will work on a wide variety of different pieces;
• You work on different projects, ensuring plenty of variety in your daily tasks;
• You ensure a precise finish and maintain high-quality standards;
• You enjoy hands-on work and are not afraid of physically demanding tasks.
As an EXPERIENCED WELDER in OSTEND, you can identify with the following:

• You have extensive and proven experience as a semi-automatic welder;
• You can work independently and accurately;
• You are able to read and interpret technical drawings;
• You are physically fit and enjoy varied work;
• You speak Dutch OR have a very good command of English.

For our client located in WESTENDE we are looking for a ROADWORKER!

Our client is a well-known contractor who does assignments for the government and private sector.

Do you like to roll up your sleeves and work outdoors? Then you are the person we are looking for!

As a ROAD WORKER in WESTENDE this is your job:

• You are responsible for sewerage works;
• You are responsible for placing embroidery;
• Construction of cycle paths, roads and car parks;
• Placing environmental pavements;
• Placing roundabouts and refuges;
• Placing vowels and paving stones;


As a ROAD WORKER in WESTENDE you can find yourself in the following

• You speak Englisch or Dutch;
• You are handy and like to work outside;
• No study requirements - motivation is what we need!

